test_vr_decisions is a decision-probe module for the type-aware persistent
Value Representation (VR) recognition/dispatch layer.

It exposes the pure, catalog-free decisions VR makes -- which VrKind values are
implemented (none in v1) and whether a datum is recognized as a VR (never, for
an ordinary value) -- so a regression test can lock the v1 invariants without
constructing a persistent VR datum, referencing any relation/TOAST value id, or
performing any body save/delete.
